# Never commit a corpus, a report, or nudge state. They contain verbatim text
# you typed in real sessions, including anything you pasted from private repos.
# Default output already lands outside this repo; these are belt-and-braces for
# anyone who points --out or --state-dir here.
corpus.md
*.corpus.md
reports/
state.json
nudge.log

node_modules/
.DS_Store
.env
.env.*
